RUNG SEQUENCE k(n) (best-known): the Farey-ladder position of the covering-min, M(n)=[0;n-1,k]=k/(k(n-1)+1).
Floor 1/n = rung 1; construction n/Phi6 = rung n; ceiling 1/(n-1) = rung inf. Covering-min rung in [2,n].
